      "response_text": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of broccoli include supporting a healthy nervous system and optimal brain function through its potassium content, regulating blood pressure due to its high potassium, magnesium, and calcium levels, providing the recommended daily amount of vitamin C, and potentially preventing cancer due to its glucoraphanin content and indole-3-carbinol antioxidants.",
      "role": "training",
      "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:25d70bd5486a0cfc2bf8da3ab8007c2e84d59f62a3f0c3f77443328ac88f1406",
